BQ questions example:
    
    1. Tell me about yourself
        - Name, education background
        - skills: primary programming language, projects experience, intern experience
        - Thank you!

        Vanriants:
        - tell me your weakness
        - 2nd chances problems:
            - retrospection
            - e.g. biggest failure during your college/work
            - key points: how to avoid/adrress the same problems in the future

    2a. when you have different opinion from your colleagues？
        - scenarios
        - communication
            - how? e.g. 1:1, buy a coffee
            - when? e.g. Friday, afternoon
            - where? e.g. at some private space like meeting room
            - what?
                - point of interest
                - keep in mind: (in a more general scope)
                    - say something for a reason
                    - how to praise someone?
                    - how to criticize someone?
            - what if?
                - backup solutions
                - how to express?
    
    2b. when you received negative feedback, what will you do?
        - communication
            - fact
            - misunderstanding

    

    3. when you have limited time available to finish your project. Quality vs speed?
        - a or b的问题千万不要选其中之一，回答it depends
        - depends on what scenario it is
        
        - variant 1: provide an example scenario in which you made a quick decision under pressure?
            - key words: quick decision - 重要性，时间顺序
        - variant 2: write an email to your manager on how to explain why you missed the deadline
            - key words: deadline - 主次，轻重缓急

