    7. Tell me one failure in the past 
        - more critical is not just to tell the story (do not just mention the excuses)
        - what learned from mistakes
        
        variant: write an email to your manager to explain why you miss the deadline.
            
    8. describe a stressful situation at work and how you handled it?
        - what is stress
        - why do we feel stressed
        - how to handle it
            - make systematic plans/preparations
            - make a little progress ad day
            - make friends find mentors
        - is it common?

    9. are random questions really reandom?
        - 这种类型的题主要考的是解决问题和思维方式
        - 关键点是确定一个framework，根据这个framework的特点寻求解决方案
            - C: clarify the problem
            - A: Assumption
            - R: Results
            - T: Test cases
        - ex. Golf balls of bus problem:
            - how to analysis how many golf balls needed to full a bus?  
                - notice that all the golf balls have same shape, volumn...
                - the volumn of bus is measurable
                ...

